(module umu_popout-ring-AT101 (layer F.Cu) (tedit 6B1E0001)
  (descr "Perforation ring for the Dell AT101 blank popout: 29 NPTH 0.5 mm holes on a 5.5 mm radius circle (46 slots at 0.75 mm pitch), holes omitted where sacrificed alternate pads cross the ring. Origin = ring centre.")
